    "BrochureContent": [
      {
        "ContentType": "Description",
        "SortOrder": 0,
        "Content": "Situated in a quiet and highly desirable position overlooking a green area, No. 183 Charlesland Grove is a beautifully maintained two-bedroom, two-bathroom home offering bright, spacious accommodation and excellent additional living space. Presented in good condition throughout, this attractive property is ideal for first-time buyers, downsizers or investors seeking a turnkey home in one of Greystones' most sought-after developments.\r\n\r\nThe accommodation comprises a welcoming entrance hall, a spacious living room, a well-appointed kitchen/dining area, two generous double bedrooms, including a principal bedroom with en-suite, and a contemporary family bathroom. A converted attic provides an excellent additional room, perfectly suited as a home office, playroom or guest accommodation, with potential to incorporate an en-suite bathroom, subject to the necessary consents.\r\n\r\nTo the front, the property benefits from off-street parking and an attractive outlook over a landscaped green, creating a wonderful sense of space. The private rear garden enjoys a sunny aspect, making it an ideal setting for outdoor dining, entertaining or relaxing.\r\n\r\nCharlesland is renowned for its family-friendly atmosphere and exceptional convenience, with an excellent selection of schools, shops, cafés, sports facilities and scenic coastal walks all within easy reach. Greystones town centre, the DART station and a wealth of recreational amenities are all nearby, while the N11/M50 provides excellent connectivity for commuters.\r\n\r\nCombining generous accommodation, a versatile attic conversion, a sunny rear garden and an enviable location overlooking a green, No. 183 Charlesland Grove presents a superb opportunity to acquire a quality home in a thriving and well-established community. Early viewing is highly recommended."
      },
      {
        "ContentType": "Features",
        "SortOrder": 3,
        "Content": "Stylish 2-bedroom townhouse\r\nTwo bathrooms\r\nConverted attic/home office space\r\nPrivate sunny rear garden\r\nOff-street parking\r\nG.F.C.H\r\nManagement  fees €484.36 per annum\r\nGreen area to the front"
      },
